// #2623 (Codex P2): the break lane's file placement, over the two pre-prelude
// snapshots a compile takes -- `names`/`name_files` for the definitions the
// source wrote, `owner_keys`/`owner_files` for the owner a synthesized name
// encodes. Exported for the sibling test: it runs the real index builder and
// the real lookup, so a test cannot pass under a collision policy the compiler
// does not have. A key two modules share answers 0 (no placement) in either
// snapshot; a wrong file id would be a claim, mapped through the wrong
// module's newline table.
